{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first person horror experience your chatacter has broken down in a foggy forest, after calling a friend for a pickup you hear a woman calling for help, instead of waiting for your friend you go searching for the woman deep in the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790770/extras/Forest.png?t=1740860489\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As some demonic presence takes control you are tasked with escaping the mind of a sinster being. Through 4 environments you must collect items, reset a generator and run for your life as you try to escape the mind of the inhuman. With nothing but a flashlight and a bit of hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items to escape the environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your flashlight to help navigate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reset a generate to turn the lights back on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">use a mask that only wearing the demon will be visible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A DIFFERENT WORLD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2790770/3d1ab7902d53eec7e845649715aa9144ed1978b3.jpg"},{"name":"Note 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2790770/3d1ab7902d53eec7e845649715aa9144ed1978b3.jpg"},{"name":"Note 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2790770/3d1ab7902d53eec7e845649715aa9144ed1978b3.jpg"},{"name":"Note 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2790770/3d1ab7902d53eec7e845649715aa9144ed1978b3.jpg"},{"name":"Note 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2790770/3d1ab7902d53eec7e845649715aa9144ed1978b3.jpg"}